<%--
_Sys_Page_Scaffold - the panel's page shell.

<Slot:main> - the page's content (required)

class="_Sys_Page_Scaffold--wide" on the invocation widens the page to 1600px (default 1400px).

Owns the panel's page max width and page padding, and nothing else, so no page
of the panel authors a layout shell of its own. Mirrors the template app's
Page_Scaffold with the sidebar column dropped: the panel has no entity sidebar.
--%>
<Define:_Sys_Page_Scaffold>
    <div class="_Sys_Page_Scaffold__main">
        <%= content('main') %>
    </div>
</Define:_Sys_Page_Scaffold>
